<div class="container" style="padding-top: var(--s-12); max-width: 720px;">
  <div class="section-label">About</div>
  <h1 class="italic-serif mb-4">About Manasyn</h1>
  <p class="text-2 mb-6" style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.7;">Manasyn is a calm AI wellness and psychology-learning platform built on a simple belief: people deserve a space where they can slow down, think clearly, and talk without being judged.</p>
  <p class="text-2 mb-6" style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.7;">For personal wellbeing, Manasyn offers supportive conversation, guided reflection, and practical self-work. For psychology students, it provides tools to practice clinical skills — case coaching, OSCE preparation, skills labs, and more.</p>
  <p class="text-2 mb-6" style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.7;">We believe mental health tools should be calm, not clinical. Human, not robotic. Structured, not gamified. That's why our design philosophy is simple: <span class="italic-serif">Calm enough for vulnerability. Modern enough for AI. Structured enough for psychology.</span></p>
  <div class="note">Manasyn is not a replacement for professional mental health care. It is a tool for self-reflection, learning, and everyday support.</div>
</div>
